facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0074","name":"文钦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0155","name":"施绩","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0126","name":"朱异","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhanggu-p0030","name":"诸葛融","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-1c19a53fc2fdfca557a9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-ffc116c405cea888a171","layer":"original","quote":"吴太傅诸葛恪以初破魏军，大兴兵众以图攻取","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o055b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2d3651c906b3924f6677","layer":"original","quote":"五年夏四月〖1〗，大赦。五月，吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城；诏太尉司马孚拒之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-aa6ace448e938821edac","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-aa6ace448e938821edac","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：嘉平五年（公元 253）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4e568bedcd1f34c38680","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o055","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2d3651c906b3924f6677","layer":"original","quote":"五年夏四月〖1〗，大赦。五月，吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城；诏太尉司马孚拒之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0016","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7bd943dc7147c2f75ba7","layer":"original","quote":"转为镇南将军。诸葛诞战于东关，不利；乃令诞、俭对换。诞为镇南，都督豫州。俭为镇东，都督扬州。吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城，俭与文钦御之；太尉司马孚督中军东，解围，恪退还。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0041","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0c032a6da7eae7e225ce","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛恪围合肥新城，不克，退归。艾言景王曰：“孙权已没，大臣未附；吴名宗大族，皆有部曲〖20〗；阻兵仗势，足以（建）〔违〕命。恪新秉国政，而内无其主；不念抚恤上下以立根基，竞于外事〖21〗，虐用其民；悉国之众，顿于坚城，死者万数，载祸而归。此恪获罪之日也。昔子胥、吴起、商鞅、乐毅皆见任时君〖22〗，主没而败。况恪才非四贤，而不虑不患，其亡可待也。”恪归，果见诛。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0221","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7bd943dc7147c2f75ba7","layer":"original","quote":"吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城，俭与文钦御之；太尉司马孚督中军东，解围，恪退还","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0340","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0c032a6da7eae7e225ce","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛恪围合肥新城，不克，退归","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-05fcc5a99f3be1ae7882","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-2644798b5c13bf211507","layer":"original","quote":"二年春〖14〗，恪向新城，要绩并力〖15〗；而留置半州，使融兼其任","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-28a47a1f106a8b7b801a","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6da951f01660a7939664","layer":"pei","quote":"异又随诸葛恪围新城，城既不拔；异等皆言宜速还豫章，袭石头城，不过数日可拔","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c647a7a3182c67039e5c","start":10,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
